to open chests.  Each chest has its own deck of cards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to getting cards and killing monsters, there are many secondary activities in the game. For example: magic, alchemy, forge, quests, resource gathering, and more.</p>",
